2026-09-24T03:54:25.4522980Z 
2026-09-24T03:54:25.4523328Z A blocked or observed runtime action is not proof that the final software works.
2026-09-24T03:54:25.4524482Z DiffWitness verifies the resulting Git change independently. Source code and raw prompts/diffs stay local by default.
2026-09-24T03:54:25.4525304Z 
2026-09-24T03:54:25.4525701Z For every command and advanced workflow: `dw view technical`, then `dw --help`.
2026-09-24T03:54:25.4526258Z 
2026-09-24T03:54:25.4527061Z Language: English by default. Save with `dw language en|fr`; override once with `dw --language en|fr <command>`. OS locale never selects product language.
